.TH SCROLLWM-SESSION 1 "March 2026" "scrollwm 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
scrollwm-session \- session wrapper for ScrollWM
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scrollwm-session
.RI [ --wait-for-wm [= SECONDS ]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B scrollwm-session
reads the ScrollWM config file and optionally launches a compositor before execing
.BR scrollwm .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --wait-for-wm
Retries startup for up to 10 seconds when another X11 window manager currently owns
SubstructureRedirect.
.TP
.BI --wait-for-wm= SECONDS
Retries startup for up to
.I SECONDS
before failing.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Uses
.I ~/.config/scrollwm/config.toml
and reads autostart settings:
.TP
.B [autostart].launch_picom
Boolean toggle.
.TP
.B [autostart].compositor
Command string for compositor launch.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scrollwm (1)
